You have mastered 49 rooms. Now combine everything you have learned!

## Tasks:

1. Find all .key files recursively in final_challenge/
   >> hint: `find final_challenge/ -name "*.key" | sort`

2. Each .key file contains a base64-encoded value. Decode all of them.
   >> hint: `base64 -d <filename>`

3. Keep only decoded values that are purely numeric.
   >> hint: `grep -E '^[0-9]+$'`

4. Sum all numeric values.
   >> hint: `paste -sd'+' | bc`

5. Run: ./getKey.sh <sum>

The master pipeline (put it all together):
   find final_challenge/ -name "*.key" | sort | \
     xargs -I{} base64 -d {} | \
     grep -E '^[0-9]+$' | \
     paste -sd'+' | bc

>> Decrypt tip for final exam:
   openssl enc -aes-256-cbc -d -a -pbkdf2 -in ../room_100/README -out ../room_100/README.txt -pass pass:PASSWORD

Good Luck !!!
